  "limitations": [
    "Single 2x2 MZI; errors in meshes accumulate and can partly be corrected by other MZIs (OPA-MZI-003)",
    "Calibration assumes the coupler splits and losses are known exactly; real calibration estimates them from measurements and has its own error",
    "Single wavelength; coupler splitting and phase both depend on wavelength",
    "No thermal crosstalk between phase shifters, no drift over time",
    "Detection noise and the power-only readout of photodetectors are not modelled",
    "Effective bits is a rough guide; it is not the same as quantized-weight precision in a trained network"
